# Roadmap article format

Path = `content/{ref}.md` where `ref` is `area/slug` linked from roadmap JSON items.

## Required shape

1. Frontmatter: `title`, `summary`; optional `video`, `image`, `image_credit`
2. `## Зачем нужно` — why it matters
3. `## Как работает` (or 1–3 topic H2s like Виды / Защита) — mechanism + optional code/links
4. `## Что спрашивают` — 2–4 bullet questions
5. `## Ответы` — one `###` per question (same text); concise interview answers

## Style

- Russian prose, English terms where natural
- Short and interview-focused; no textbook padding
- Every «Что спрашивают» bullet must have a matching «Ответы» `###`
- Credit media in `image_credit` when `video`/`image` present
